d@google.com","date":"2022-01-19 17:09:52.000000000","tz":0},"committer":{"name":"Michael Benfield","email":"mbenfield@google.com","date":"2022-01-23 18:48:25.000000000","tz":0},"subject":"llvm-next: upgrade to 18308e171b5b1dd99627a4d88c7d6c5ff21b8c96 (r445002)","message":"llvm-next: upgrade to 18308e171b5b1dd99627a4d88c7d6c5ff21b8c96 (r445002)\n\nThe following packages have been updated:\ndev-util/lldb-server\nsys-devel/llvm\nsys-libs/compiler-rt\nsys-libs/libcxx\nsys-libs/libcxxabi\nsys-libs/llvm-libunwind\n\nThe following reverts were added to sys-devel/llvm to resolve conflicts\nof applying revert-88003cea1c6eb3ebcb18b4f1b9d0e2052dd76fe4.patch:\n- revert-7fb66d4035960b3c2797eae73d79b8478ff0348e.patch\n- revert-bd020bbbd29e3a30f6697d6b077d28d79b3a3a9d.patch\n\n(Note that in return\nrevert-88003cea1c6eb3ebcb18b4f1b9d0e2052dd76fe4.patch itself was added\nto resolve conflicts of applying\nrevert-f5446b769a7929806f72256fccd4826d66502e59.patch (b/194845770)).\n\nCherry pick another LLVM patch for unsupported addressing mode.\n\nAn earlier commit, 8c977dd5b523c125aec7fc50bd5a6d228e98df8e,\ncherry-picked an LLVM patch, but it turns out that patch\ndepends on this one.\n\nBUG\u003db:213618377,b:209885045\nTEST\u003dCQ\n\nChange-Id: I2fa019af89c686edc37a35f711e03524f8135174\nReviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromiumos/overlays/chromiumos-overlay/+/3401878\nReviewed-by: Denis Nikitin \u003cdenik@chromium.org\u003e\nReviewed-by: Manoj Gupta \u003cmanojgupta@chromium.org\u003e\nTested-by: Michael Benfield \u003cmbenfield@google.com\u003e\n"},"branch":"refs/heads/main","description":"Rebase"}}},{"id":"chromiumos%2Foverlays%2Fchromiumos-overlay~3325081","triplet_id":"chromiumos%2Foverlays%2Fchromiumos-overlay~main~Ib5289c8b9b25ee646711f2c90d00f058d703dbb2","project":"chromiumos/overlays/chromiumos-overlay","branch":"main","full_branch":"refs/heads/main","attention_set":{},"removed_from_attention_set":{"1347075":{"account":{"_account_id":1347075},"last_up